        "iso_639_1": "fr",
        "name": "Français",
        "english_name": "French",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "https://pan-europeenne.com/film/si-tu-penses-bien/",
          "overview": "A Dubaï, Gil rencontre Jacques. Leur coup de foudre débouche sur un mariage précipité qui révèle vite une fracture profonde : Gil ne partage pas la foi dévorante de son mari. Jacques tente de la soumettre à sa vision du monde avec un mantra aux allures de menace.",
          "runtime": 94,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "US",
        "iso_639_1": "en",
        "name": "English",
        "english_name": "English",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "When Gil meets Jacques, their love seems irresistible. And when she unexpectedly falls pregnant, he convinces her to start a family. However, their hasty marriage reveals that she is not as deeply rooted into the Jewish faith as he is. Jacques reassures her: \"Think good and it will be good\". Little by little, Gil realizes the insidious control he exerts over her life...",
          "runtime": 94,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "Think Good"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "PL",
        "iso_639_1": "pl",
        "name": "Polski",
        "english_name": "Polish",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "W Dubaju, Gil poznaje Jacques'a. Ich burzliwy romans prowadzi do pochopnego małżeństwa, które szybko ujawnia głęboki rozdźwięk: Gil nie podziela żarliwej wiary męża. Jacques próbuje zmusić ją do przyjęcia jego światopoglądu za pomocą mantry, która brzmi jak groźba.",
          "runtime": 94,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "Przemyśl to"
        }
      }
    ]
